{"quest":"Monk's Friend","character":"Brother Cedric","text":"Pleashhh, find me a jug of water. Once I'm sober I'll 'elp you take the wine back.","uri":"086e077a11ed2dece51c96c7947979d8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Monk's Friend","character":"Brother Cedric","text":"Thanks! *hic*","uri":"b25a9e81d9b72df125a371731ff7a76b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Monk's Friend","character":"Brother Cedric","text":"Well done! Now I'll fix this cart. You head back to Brother Omad and tell him I'll be there soon.","uri":"2782f43def1a3d315765174f8348b4f7.mp3"}
