{"quest":"Monk's Friend","character":"Brother Omad","text":"*yawn*..I'm off to bed! Farewell brave traveller!","uri":"a55abfc2873b34fab7d52ff8c76d53dd.mp3"}
{"quest":"Monk's Friend","character":"Brother Omad","text":"Cedric is a member of the order too. We sent him out three days ago to collect wine. But he didn't return!","uri":"b277f43839ae7c5f7da71f45cfa8df85.mp3"}
{"quest":"Monk's Friend","character":"Brother Omad","text":"Dum dee do la la! *hiccup* That was some party!","uri":"92d0ac93a0afbdaa7c28ac9d203d2c98.mp3"}
{"quest":"Monk's Friend","character":"Brother Omad","text":"Get down!","uri":"8ffaab700c166634e835ea4623669a13.mp3"}
